From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: lumia-talkman: drop the camera keys

The camera focus key (PM8994 GPIO 5) has no pull-up and reads as held from
boot; gpio-keys then auto-repeats it forever, which keeps resetting the
console blank timer. Remove both camera keys; volume up stays.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8992-msft-lumia-octagon-talkman.dts	2026-11-15 10:15:42.014431396 +0530
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8992-msft-lumia-octagon-talkman.dts	2026-11-15 10:15:42.040624199 +0530
@@ -487,3 +487,13 @@
 		max-reason = <3>;
 	};
 };
+
+/*
+ * No camera keys: the focus key's PMIC GPIO 5 has no pull-up and reads as
+ * held from boot, which auto-repeats forever and keeps the console from ever
+ * blanking. Volume up stays.
+ */
+&{/gpio-keys} {
+	/delete-node/ camsnap-key;
+	/delete-node/ camfocus-key;
+};
